# Egress allowlist (tinyproxy FilterDefaultDeny On + FilterExtended On).
# Each line is an extended regex matched against the DESTINATION HOST. A host is
# reachable ONLY if it matches one of these. Keep this set CLOSED and minimal —
# every addition widens the agent's exfiltration surface. Anchored to avoid a
# substring like "evil-discord.com.attacker.net" matching.
#
# Required for intended function (everything else fails closed by design):

# Model — the host-side model-key proxy (plain HTTP :8787, reached via host.docker.internal).
^host\.docker\.internal$

# Discord — bot gateway (WS), REST API, and media/CDN.
(^|\.)discord\.com$
(^|\.)discord\.gg$
(^|\.)discordapp\.com$
(^|\.)discordapp\.net$

# Web research — Tavily does BOTH search and extract server-side (config overlay
# sets web.search_backend: tavily), so the agent never fetches arbitrary URLs.
(^|\.)tavily\.com$
